{"title":"Gazebound Basilisk","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 25 Basilisk that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/basilisk-gazebound\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/basilisk-gazebound?lv=25\">Lv 25</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/basilisk-gazebound?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>5</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/basilisk-gazebound?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/basilisk-gazebound?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 2 recorded drops, 259 total, 128–131 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×128–131</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 2 of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 7 total, 3–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"basilisk-hide\" title=\"Basilisk Hide - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/92ba5da9ce736ad2f55e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Basilisk Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-spear\" title=\"Gold Spear - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ce35959c3f749f0efc83.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Spear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-dagger\" title=\"Gold Dagger (of-freezing x1) - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/269b85f477087ff1c8e4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"basilisk-scale\" title=\"Basilisk Scale - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a5ed9e1dc0e4fec30424.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Basilisk Scale</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-kryss\" title=\"Gold Kryss - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f34cb12d01760f5e9019.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(2)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/vell\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/15cf0f405f80e466dc70.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Vell</b><span>Lv 28</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/gorrsa\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/322b545c7a280222aa18.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Gorrsa</b><span>Lv 28</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Basilisk: <a href=\"#/monster/sand-basilisk\">Sand Basilisk</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/basilisk-matriarch\">Basilisk Matriarch</a> <span class=\"muted\">(27)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/basilisk\">Basilisk</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-basilisk\">Elder Basilisk</a> <span class=\"muted\">(36)</span></p>\n      <p clas